<p>As a hiring manager, a few things immediately pop out. First, there is f=
ar too much bolding. And the things that are bolded are inconsistent. Why i=
s =E2=80=9CW4 forms=E2=80=9D bolded, when the application is for a tech com=
pany where the work has nothing to do with taxes? Second, the formatting is=
 inconsistent. Font sizes are different, and alignment is off. Finally, the=
 language used is sloppy in places.</p>
<p><strong>Visualizing the issues:</strong></p>
